# Project: cassandra-commitlog-connector

A custom Kafka Connect Source Connector for tailing Cassandra 4.x commit logs (CDC) without Debezium Cassandra4 plugin.

```
cassandra-commitlog-connector/
├── pom.xml
└── src/
    └── main/
        ├── java/com/example/cdc/
        │   ├── CassandraCommitLogConnector.java
        │   ├── CassandraCommitLogTask.java
        │   └── config/CassandraSourceConfig.java
        └── resources/
            └── META-INF/services/
                └── org.apache.kafka.connect.connector.Connector
```

